Subject: util/anon_file: force raw memfd_create syscall on Android (Termux)

Termux's libc (bionic) may not expose the memfd_create prototype even though
meson's pkg-config check sets HAVE_MEMFD_CREATE. On Android force the
raw-syscall path (SYS_memfd_create) so util/anon_file works.

Applied by build_termux.sh (python string patch); this file is the reference.

--- a/src/util/anon_file.c
+++ b/src/util/anon_file.c
@@
 #include "anon_file.h"
 #include "detect_os.h"

+#if defined(__ANDROID__) && defined(HAVE_MEMFD_CREATE)
+#undef HAVE_MEMFD_CREATE
+#endif
+
 #ifndef _WIN32
